        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "&nbsp;\n\nHey Guys,\n\nThe games that won the Dexterity game contest look very interesting!&nbsp;\n\nAre we going to see any of these games in the store or on a Kickstarter soon?&nbsp; I&#39;ll be honest, the two I am most interested in are the two runner ups, but I could easily be swayed to buy the other 2 as well.  :slightly_smiling_face: \n\n&nbsp;\n\nI think it&#39;s really great that Dice Hate Me runs these contests.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp; Gooday,\n\n&nbsp; Richie",
